{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy Demo</strong> reacts in real time to your keyboard and mouse actions. Every click and every movement triggers adorable interactive feedback from your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are working or studying, Bit Buddy will always be on your screen, becoming your most loyal digital companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo version, you can collect and use <strong>a selection of decorations and pet skins</strong> to give your Bit Buddy a unique look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo does not include the achievement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full range of decorations and the achievement system are available in the full version.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950450?t=1756022191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950450/53a37308f3e466fa81cb16752037c3b528c1177b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756022191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950450/0f5bd5c8ae46db450b688ffb58ffd468bb5cca81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756022191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950450/0f5bd5c8ae46db450b688ffb58ffd468bb5cca81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756022191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy Demo</strong> reacts in real time to your keyboard and mouse actions. Every click and every movement triggers adorable interactive feedback from your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether y